-$\int_{B_\rho}|\mathbf a_b|^2\le\int|\mathbf a_b|^2\varphi_0(\xi/\rho)d\xi
-=\sum_{m,m'}b_m\bar b_{m'}\rho^d\widehat{\varphi_0}(\rho(x_{m'}-x_m))$, and
