+  |\xi|^2\sum_j|\sum_m a_mx_{m,j}e^{ix_m\xi}|^2$ pointwise, then apply
+  (i) with $b_m=a_mx_{m,j}$ — gives exactly the needed
+  $\lesssim\rho^2\cdot\frac14\sum a_m^2\asymp\delta^{-2}\sum a_m^2$;
+  one line of repair, currently absent.)
